2
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:50,100
言い訳ばかりまいて
Spreading excuses all around,

3
00:02:50,300 --> 00:02:55,800
横切った未来 触れとうに くれないよう
so the passing future won't slip away unattained.

4
00:02:58,100 --> 00:03:04,900
未知数が憧れに 絡まったって 奪えやしない
Even if unknowns entangle with my yearnings, they cannot be taken away.

5
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:09,100
空を創ろう
Let's create the sky!

6
00:03:09,100 --> 00:03:16,000
散らかったパズル 組み合わせても 足りない
Even when combined, scattered puzzles are not enough.

7
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:25,800
壁に写した 知らない世界の 前にあった重い扉開け
Opening the heavy door that stood before a world unknown, projected on the wall,

8
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:30,800
忘れてた少年の 絵のように
like a painting of a forgotten boy—

9
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:37,000
温度は高く 微熱まじりで 夢はなしていたい
with high warmth and a hint of a slight fever, I want to keep dreaming.

10
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:44,800
もう憧れは 描きあくて 全部を見るため 空いたアトリエ
Yearning no more to just paint, an open atelier to see everything—

11
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:53,000
空いたアトリエ 帰るアトリエ いつかは
an open atelier, a returning atelier, someday...

12
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:04,500
想像して かきなぐって
Imagining and scribbling away,

13
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:11,000
塗り替えても 外はもっと 進んでいた
even when repainted, the outside world kept moving further ahead.

14
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:19,000
不揃いな 景色の中 棘が刺さっても 走ってみたい
Amidst a mismatched scenery, even if thorns pierce me, I want to try running.

15
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:23,000
道を創ろう
Let's create a path!

16
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:30,800
遠くなるほど 細く薄れて 描けない
The further away it gets, the thinner and fainter it becomes, impossible to draw.

17
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:39,800
イメージをした 近い未来 ぼやけたら 重い扉開け
Once I envisioned the near future and it blurred, I opened the heavy door,

18
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:44,800
その心 大胆に 染めよう
dyeing that heart boldly.

19
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:50,000
いつかの絵さえ 霞くらいの 夢生み出したい
I want to create dreams hazy enough to blur even paintings of the past.

20
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:59,000
成果なんてわからない きっと それでも 去ったアトリエ
Not knowing what the result will be, surely it's still the atelier I left behind.

21
00:05:00,330 --> 00:05:01,750
ざっとアトリエ
Reaching my atelier...

22
00:05:02,110 --> 00:05:04,910
僕のアトリエ
My atelier,

23
00:05:05,150 --> 00:05:08,390
いつでも
anytime...

24
00:05:17,310 --> 00:05:19,470
どれだけ濡れても
No matter how wet it gets,

25
00:05:19,750 --> 00:05:21,730
擦ったって消えない
rubbing won't erase it.

26
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:24,470
戻せない
Reality cannot

27
00:05:24,470 --> 00:05:27,290
現実は鮮やか
be undone; it's so vivid.

28
00:05:28,010 --> 00:05:32,730
忘れてた少年の絵のように
Like a painting of a forgotten boy,

29
00:05:33,230 --> 00:05:35,310
温度は高く
the temperature is high,

30
00:05:35,510 --> 00:05:38,290
微熱まじりで夢話していたい
mixed with a slight fever, I want to dream.

31
00:05:39,230 --> 00:05:43,090
もう憧れは描き飽きて
I'm tired of drawing my yearnings.

32
00:05:43,770 --> 00:05:45,390
全部を見るため
To see everything,

33
00:05:45,630 --> 00:05:47,390
開いたアトリエ
an open atelier—

34
00:05:47,470 --> 00:05:50,090
開いたアトリエ
an open atelier.

35
00:05:51,250 --> 00:05:53,390
帰るアトリエ
Returning atelier,

36
00:05:53,650 --> 00:05:56,010
いつかは
someday...

37
00:06:18,898 --> 00:06:20,378
ふぅ…
Whew...

38
00:06:21,398 --> 00:06:25,638
皆さんこんにちは！ホロライブ3期生の不知火フレアです！
Hello everyone! I'm Shiranui Flare from Hololive 3rd Generation!

39
00:06:26,558 --> 00:06:31,738
今日は私の生誕祭ライブ2024にお越し下さり、皆さんありがとうございます！
Thank you all so much for coming to my Birthday Live 2024 today!

40
00:06:33,518 --> 00:06:36,583
そんじゃって…見てくださいこのステージ！
And look at this stage!

41
00:06:36,963 --> 00:06:40,443
すっごく可愛いでしょう！
Isn't it super cute?!

42
00:06:40,923 --> 00:06:46,823
この日のために運営さんに作ってもらいました！本当にありがとうございます！
The management made this especially for this day! Thank you so much!

43
00:06:48,223 --> 00:06:54,683
今日はこのステージでたくさん盛り上がっていくから、一緒にみんなで盛り上がろうね！
Today we're going to get super hyped on this stage, so let's get excited together everyone!

44
00:06:55,243 --> 00:07:01,823
そして今日はゲストもたくさんいるので、ゲストのみんなともたくさん歌っちゃうよ！
And since we have lots of guests today, I'll be singing a lot with everyone too!

45
00:07:02,143 --> 00:07:08,323
ハッシュタグはこちら、「不知火フレア生誕祭2024」でたくさんポストしてね！
The hashtag is here: #ShiranuiFlareBirthday2024, so please post a lot!

46
00:07:08,863 --> 00:07:14,383
それでは今日はみんなでたくさん盛り上がっていきましょう！いくぞ！
Now then, let's all get super hyped today! Here we go!

47
00:07:23,473 --> 00:07:26,553
ドクドクシテルコトバッカリアッパレスシタイアジワウミライ
Throbbing words only—praiseworthy, tasting the future!

48
00:07:27,193 --> 00:07:30,373
サッパリスシタイアジワウミライ
Refreshing, tasting the future!

49
00:07:38,263 --> 00:07:41,523
痛んだ小競り合いは 伸び切った舌戦なんか
Hurtful petty bickering and drawn-out verbal battles

50
00:07:41,883 --> 00:07:44,903
飽きて匙を投げる そりゃ遠くに
I'm sick of and throw my spoon away, far into the distance.

51
00:07:45,343 --> 00:07:52,243
巡り巡ってあなたのために掬う ああ スプーンにでもなれたらいいな
Circling around to scoop for you—ah, if I could just become a spoon!

52
00:07:53,083 --> 00:07:59,823
絵に描いたご馳走じゃないのに フォンから作るソースじゃないのに ちょっとばっかなぜでしょう垂涎ものね
Though it's not a feast drawn in pictures, nor a sauce made from stock, somehow it's drool-worthy!

53
00:08:00,283 --> 00:08:05,963
色鮮やかなサラダボウルに 好き嫌いも笑って試して 案外好きになってるじゃん
In a colorful salad bowl, laughing and trying likes and dislikes—turns out you've grown to like it!

54
00:08:06,783 --> 00:08:11,843
鈍色の天気の日には 厚い雲を裂いていくような
On gloomy-colored days, like tearing through thick clouds,

55
00:08:12,023 --> 00:08:15,923
風を見てみたい 魔法を見てみたい
I want to see the wind, I want to see magic!

56
00:08:16,643 --> 00:08:19,863
思いつくだけのレシピを眺めて
Gazing at recipes just as I think of them,

57
00:08:20,023 --> 00:08:23,803
振る舞おうぜ何回だって できたての料理を
I'll treat you as many times as you want to freshly made dishes!

58
00:08:24,043 --> 00:08:29,883
満員の笑みが見られたのなら 創造の手間もどうだっていい
If I can see your full smile, the trouble of creation doesn't matter at all!

59
00:08:30,943 --> 00:08:34,923
知らない巡り合わせは とんでもない未来
An unknown twist of fate leads to an extraordinary future—

60
00:08:35,323 --> 00:08:44,483
分け合えると知るんだ 不揃いな皿でも 運命御馳走一杯 朝まで目いっぱい 話そう大小希望のプランを
realizing we can share even mismatched plates! A feast of destiny, eating our fill until morning, let's talk of big and small hopeful plans!

61
00:08:45,383 --> 00:08:47,423
そうやって贅沢な匙を探していこう
That's how we'll search for a luxurious spoon.

62
00:08:51,583 --> 00:08:54,683
ぬくもりも まどろみも
Both warmth and slumber

63
00:08:55,383 --> 00:08:59,443
今日の最速で 飛んでく準備するから
I'll prepare to fly off with today's top speed,

64
00:08:59,883 --> 00:09:02,063
連れてって欲しいのさ
so I want you to take me along!

65
00:09:02,563 --> 00:09:05,483
朝日がよく見えるあの丘に
To that hill where the morning sun shines bright,

66
00:09:05,783 --> 00:09:13,303
レジャーシートの用意も ブランケットの装備も すべてぱっと集めて揃ったよ 思い付きのキャンピングへ
leisure sheet ready, blanket equipped, I've gathered everything in a snap! Off to an impromptu camping trip!

67
00:09:16,583 --> 00:09:20,203
誰でも巻き込み招待
Inviting and dragging anyone along!

68
00:09:20,603 --> 00:09:27,763
思いっ切り期待が空ぶったとしても 理不尽ばっか襲ってきたって言いたくなっても
Even if expectations completely miss the mark, even if unreasonable things keep attacking and make me want to complain,

69
00:09:28,223 --> 00:09:34,463
どうやったってダメな日もあるけど その失敗もスパイスなんだろう
there are days when nothing goes right no matter what, but even those failures must be the spice of life!

70
00:09:34,983 --> 00:09:42,323
初めての料理がどんな苦くても 誇らしく思うんだ 傷テープ貼った手で やりきって精一杯
No matter how bitter my first dish turns out, I feel proud of it! With hands patched up with band-aids, I gave it my absolute all.

71
00:09:43,963 --> 00:09:48,103
後悔しない失敗 明日にはそう思えるのかな
A failure with no regrets—I wonder if I'll be able to think that way tomorrow?

72
00:09:55,783 --> 00:09:59,083
マダムダシラナイコトバッカリ
Madam, there are so many things I don't know!

73
00:09:59,563 --> 00:10:01,363
ユックリイコウサンカンシタレ
Let's take it easy and participate!

74
00:10:00,625 --> 00:10:02,325
ゆっくり行こう まったりしたい
Let's take it easy and relax.

75
00:10:02,411 --> 00:10:05,856
単純に浸る好奇心
Pure curiosity to immerse myself in.

76
00:10:05,856 --> 00:10:09,556
たっぷり満たそう
Let's fill ourselves up completely.

77
00:10:10,206 --> 00:10:14,706
隣に居たい ささやかな気持ち秘めて
Wanting to stay by your side, hiding a small feeling...

78
00:10:14,706 --> 00:10:19,856
少し怯えている不安な夜は
On nights when I feel a little scared and anxious,

79
00:10:19,856 --> 00:10:26,856
弱い心照らすような 星を見ていたい 魔法を見てみたい
I want to see stars that light up a weak heart, I want to see magic.

80
00:10:28,056 --> 00:10:31,556
思いつくだけのレシピを眺めて
Gazing at all the recipes I can think of,

81
00:10:31,556 --> 00:10:39,056
振る舞おうぜ何回だってできたての料理を 満面の笑みが見られたのなら
Serving freshly made dishes over and over, if I can see your full smile.

82
00:10:39,056 --> 00:10:46,056
創造の手間もどうだっていい 贅沢まで会えたとんでもない世界
No matter the hassle of creation, what an incredible world where we met in luxury!

83
00:10:46,056 --> 00:10:52,056
食べ尽くしていくんだ酸いも甘いも全部 熱いままにいっぱい大好きなをいっぱい
Devouring everything, both bitter and sweet, piping hot and full of my favorites!

84
00:10:52,056 --> 00:10:56,856
詰めよう大盛ご機嫌なメニューに
Let's pack it into a hearty, cheerful menu.

85
00:10:56,856 --> 00:11:04,056
運命が小皿一杯 朝まで一杯 話そう大小希望のプランを
Fate in a small plate, a full cup until morning, let's talk about big and small plans of hope.

86
00:11:04,056 --> 00:11:07,556
そうやって贅沢な日を探していこう
Let's keep searching for luxurious days like that.

87
00:11:47,356 --> 00:11:51,556
愚かでいいのだろう
It's okay to be foolish,

88
00:11:51,556 --> 00:11:56,056
身を浸す夢の跡
immersing myself in the remnants of dreams.

89
00:11:56,056 --> 00:12:01,856
さようなら 藍き日々よ
Goodbye, blue days.

90
00:12:18,556 --> 00:12:24,056
流れに身を任せ いつか大人になっていく
Letting the current take me, someday growing up...

91
00:12:24,056 --> 00:12:29,556
少しずつ汚れていく事なの?
Is it about gradually getting dirty?

92
00:12:31,556 --> 00:12:36,556
熟した果実だけ選ばれて
Only ripe fruits are chosen,

93
00:12:36,556 --> 00:12:42,556
ナイフで裂かれて 呑み込まれる前に
sliced with a knife before being swallowed.

94
00:12:45,056 --> 00:12:48,056
僕等は目指した Shangri-La
We aimed for Shangri-La,

95
00:12:48,056 --> 00:12:52,556
欲望は抑えきれずに
unable to hold back our desires,

96
00:12:52,556 --> 00:12:58,056
空想にまみれた 「自由」を求め続けた
wrapped in fantasies, we kept seeking "freedom."

97
00:12:59,056 --> 00:13:04,556
今なら言えるだろう 此処がそう楽園さ
Now I can say it, this is paradise!

98
00:13:04,556 --> 00:13:10,056
さようなら 藍き日々よ
Goodbye, blue days.

99
00:13:20,056 --> 00:13:26,556
大切な何かを 踏み台にしてまでも
Even if it meant stepping on something precious,

100
00:13:26,556 --> 00:13:31,856
一番高い林檎 掴みたかった
I wanted to grab the highest apple.

101
00:13:32,256 --> 00:13:37,556
なくしてから気付く 尊いモノ
Realizing precious things only after losing them,

102
00:13:37,556 --> 00:13:42,556
幼い僕等は 的はずれだらけさ
We were so off-target as kids.

103
00:13:47,256 --> 00:13:54,056
満ち足りた日々の制裁は 感情不安定になる
The sanction of fulfilled days makes emotions unstable,

104
00:13:54,056 --> 00:13:59,856
傷を負ってでも 羽ばたきたいと願うよ
Wishing to spread wings even if bearing scars.

105
00:14:00,056 --> 00:14:04,556
愚かでいいのだろう 見渡す夢の痕
It's okay to be foolish, looking over the remnants of dreams.

106
00:14:04,556 --> 00:14:11,256
さようなら 藍き日々よ
Goodbye, blue days.

107
00:14:40,056 --> 00:14:46,556
輝く空は 無邪気を装い 全てを知っていた...
The shining sky feigned innocence and knew everything...

108
00:14:47,056 --> 00:14:57,056
僕等は目指した Shangri-La
We aimed for Shangri-La...

109
00:14:57,056 --> 00:15:00,056
欲望は...
Desires...

110
00:15:00,508 --> 00:15:04,108
愚かでいいのだろう 見渡す夢の痕
It's okay to be foolish, looking over the remnants of dreams,

111
00:15:04,568 --> 00:15:07,488
さよなら 蒼き日々よ
goodbye, blue days.

112
00:15:07,648 --> 00:15:10,928
流れに身を任せ いつか大人になっていく
Letting the current take me, someday I'll grow up

113
00:15:10,928 --> 00:15:13,688
少しずつ汚れていく事なのは？
and slowly get a little dirty...

114
00:15:14,308 --> 00:15:16,968
熟した果実だけ 選ばれて
Only the ripe fruit gets chosen,

115
00:15:16,968 --> 00:15:20,248
ナイフで裂かれて 飲み込まれる前に
sliced with a knife before being swallowed.

116
00:15:20,248 --> 00:15:23,308
僕等は目指した Shangri-La
We aimed for Shangri-La.

117
00:15:23,308 --> 00:15:26,628
欲求は抑えきれずに
Unable to control our desires,

118
00:15:26,628 --> 00:15:30,088
空想にまみれた 「自由」を求め続けた
wrapped up in fantasies, we kept seeking freedom.

119
00:15:30,088 --> 00:15:33,548
今なら言えるだろう 此処がそう楽園さ
Now I can say it, this is paradise.

120
00:15:33,548 --> 00:15:35,408
さよなら 蒼き日々よ
Goodbye, blue days.

121
00:15:42,028 --> 00:15:45,408
大切な何かを 踏み台にしてまでも
Even if it meant stepping on something precious,

122
00:15:45,408 --> 00:15:48,408
一番高い林檎 掴みたかった
I wanted to grab the highest apple.

123
00:15:48,408 --> 00:15:51,408
無くしてから気付く 尊いモノ
Realizing the precious things after losing them,

124
00:15:51,408 --> 00:15:54,568
幼い僕等は 的はずれだらけさ
we were so off-target as kids.

125
00:15:54,568 --> 00:15:57,488
満ち足りた日々の制圧は
The oppression of fulfilled days

126
00:15:57,488 --> 00:16:00,688
感情不安定になる
makes us emotionally unstable.

127
00:16:00,688 --> 00:16:04,028
傷を負ってでも 羽ばたきたいと願う
Even if we bear scars, we wish to spread our wings.

128
00:16:21,479 --> 00:16:23,779
青のすみか<br>作詞作曲：Tatsuya Kitani
[Song: Where Our Blue Is<br>Lyrics & Music: Tatsuya Kitani]

129
00:16:24,305 --> 00:16:29,425
どこまでも続くような 青の季節は
In the season of blue that seemed to go on forever,

130
00:16:29,905 --> 00:16:35,165
四つ並ぶ目の前を遮るものは 何もない
nothing obstructed the view of the four lined eyes.

131
00:16:36,725 --> 00:16:41,725
アスファルト、蝉時雨を反射して
The asphalt ground reflected the chorus of cicadas,

132
00:16:41,885 --> 00:16:47,405
君という沈黙が 聞こえなくなる
preventing me from hearing the silence of you.

133
00:16:47,765 --> 00:16:50,085
この日々が 色褪せる
Those days faded away,

134
00:16:50,085 --> 00:16:55,425
僕と違う君の匂いを知ってしまっても
even after I got to know your scent, different from mine.

135
00:16:55,425 --> 00:16:58,625
置き忘れてきた永遠の底に
In the depths of eternity left behind,

136
00:16:58,625 --> 00:17:01,185
今でも青が澱んでいる 今でも青が澄んでいる
our blue still lingers, our blue is still clear.

137
00:17:08,645 --> 00:17:14,725
どんな祈りも言葉も 近づけるのに、届かなかった
No prayer or word could ever reach you, no matter how close they got.

138
00:17:17,985 --> 00:17:23,805
まるで、静かな恋のような 頬を伝った夏のような色の中
Like a silent love, or a summer rolling down a cheek,

139
00:17:23,805 --> 00:17:29,965
君を呪う言葉が ずっと喉の奥につかえている
I’ve got a curse word for you stuck in the back of my throat.

140
00:17:29,965 --> 00:17:33,445
「また会えるよね」って 声にならない声
It is the unvoiced voice that says "We'll meet again, won't we?"

141
00:17:41,805 --> 00:17:46,725
昼下がり、じりつく風の季節は
In the season of damp winds in the late afternoon,

142
00:17:47,425 --> 00:17:53,445
想い馳せる、まだ何者でもなかった僕らの肖像
I think of the image of us who were still nobody.

143
00:17:55,745 --> 00:18:00,725
何かも分かり合えたはずだった
We could have shared everything.

144
00:18:01,565 --> 00:18:05,865
あの日から少しずつ 君と違う僕という呪いが肥えていく
Little by little since that day, the curse of me being different from you grew thicker.

145
00:18:09,685 --> 00:18:17,445
(La-la-la-la, la-la-la-la)

146
00:18:18,225 --> 00:18:23,545
君の笑顔の奥の憂いを見落としたこと、悔やみ尽くして
The sorrow behind your smile—all the way I've regretted missing it.

147
00:18:38,085 --> 00:18:42,665
徒花と咲いて散っていく君に さよなら
To you, who bloomed and fell away as a fruitless flower, farewell.

148
00:18:46,405 --> 00:18:52,405
今でも青が澱んでいる 今でも青が澄んでいる
Our blue still lingers, our blue is still clear.

149
00:18:52,405 --> 00:18:58,405
どんな祈りも言葉も 近づけるのに、届かなかった
No prayer or word could ever reach you, no matter how close they got.

150
00:18:58,405 --> 00:19:05,165
まるで、静かな恋のような 頬を伝った夏のような色の中
Like a silent love, or a summer rolling down a cheek,

151
00:19:05,165 --> 00:19:11,105
君を呪う言葉が ずっと喉の奥につかえている
I've got a curse word for you stuck in the back of my throat.

152
00:19:11,105 --> 00:19:14,465
「また会えるよね」って 声にならない声
It is the unvoiced voice that says "We'll meet again, won't we?"

153
00:19:18,085 --> 00:19:26,665
無限に膨張する銀河の星の粒のように 指の隙間を零れた
Like star grains in an infinitely expanding galaxy, spilling through the gaps between my fingers.

154
00:19:41,459 --> 00:19:45,419
越えて行こう 君と
Let's go beyond, together with you.

155
00:19:47,439 --> 00:19:52,579
Soul salvation<br>作詩：MEGUMI 作曲：たかはしごう
[Song: Soul salvation<br>Lyrics: MEGUMI / Music: Go Takahashi]

156
00:19:53,559 --> 00:19:58,439
希望に溢れた未来 押し付けられている
A future flooded with hope is being forced upon us.

157
00:20:00,248 --> 00:20:04,626
放り出された夢たちに 心が動けない
To the cast-aside dreams, my heart cannot move.

158
00:20:06,126 --> 00:20:11,926
それでも前進めという 想いに導かれて
Even so, guided by the desire to push forward,

159
00:20:12,226 --> 00:20:18,126
踏み出したその先 世界が変わる
The world beyond where I stepped out changes.

160
00:20:18,926 --> 00:20:25,626
凍り付く氷を溶かせるものは 熱く燃え盛る魂
What can melt the freezing ice is a passionately burning soul.

161
00:20:26,126 --> 00:20:30,626
眠らせていた まだ見ぬ力呼び起こせ
Awaken the unseen power that was slumbering!

162
00:20:30,926 --> 00:20:39,126
大丈夫さ 繰り返す呟く 言葉は力生み出す
It's okay, repeating and whispering words create power.

163
00:20:39,326 --> 00:20:45,126
其処底力には まだ先がある 突き抜けろ
From right here, there's still a ways to go, break through!

164
00:20:46,126 --> 00:20:51,626
心の全力は 笑顔のため
The full strength of the heart is for smiles.

165
00:20:52,326 --> 00:20:59,926
涙の向こう側を 超えて行ける 君と
I can go beyond the tears with you.

166
00:21:06,226 --> 00:21:11,926
正しさを纏いながら 言葉の群れたちが
While maintaining righteousness, the flocks of words

167
00:21:12,126 --> 00:21:18,126
勇気怪我傷を広げる 意識のないままに
bravely spread wounds, without any awareness.

168
00:21:19,126 --> 00:21:24,626
それでもそこに 見えない愛 見つけられたとしたら
Even so, if we could find an invisible love there,

169
00:21:25,126 --> 00:21:30,626
一つの光が世界を変える
A single light changes the world.

170
00:21:31,126 --> 00:21:38,926
深い愛を 一瞬の姿を変えて 恨みの希望をむく
Changing deep love into a fleeting form, facing the hope of resentment.

171
00:21:39,126 --> 00:21:44,326
裏切りがうむ 迷う心抱き締めて
Embrace the wavering heart born of betrayal.

172
00:21:44,626 --> 00:21:51,926
培った友情を 些細な誤解で 傷をつけ合って
Cultivated friendships get hurt by trivial misunderstandings.

173
00:21:52,126 --> 00:21:56,926
でも乗り越えて 絆となれば揺らがない
But once overcome, bonds become unshakable.

174
00:22:00,126 --> 00:22:04,926
後悔があるから また歩ける
Because there are regrets, I can walk again.

175
00:22:05,126 --> 00:22:11,926
雑音切り裂いて 超えて行こう 君と
Cut through the noise and let's go beyond, with you.

176
00:22:32,126 --> 00:22:39,926
凍り付く氷を溶かせるものは 熱く燃え盛る魂
What can melt the freezing ice is a passionately burning soul.

177
00:22:40,126 --> 00:22:44,926
眠らせていた まだ見ぬ力呼び起こせ
Awaken the unseen power that was slumbering!

178
00:22:45,126 --> 00:22:53,126
大丈夫さ 繰り返す呟く 言葉は力生み出す
It's okay, repeating and whispering words create power.

179
00:22:53,326 --> 00:22:59,126
其処底力には まだ先がある 突き抜けろ
From right here, there's still a ways to go, break through!

180
00:23:00,126 --> 00:23:05,626
心の全力は 笑顔のため
The full strength of the heart is for smiles.

181
00:23:06,126 --> 00:23:13,126
涙の向こう側を 超えて行ける 君と
I can go beyond the tears with you.

182
00:23:40,626 --> 00:23:46,126
じっと日々を見逃さないで きっと大人ぶるらしくするので かかりきりになるんだ
Don't let days slip by fixedly, acting like grown-ups so we get absorbed.

183
00:23:47,626 --> 00:23:57,126
話はまだ僕ら 真珠の欠片だって無価値 そこに物語がなければ
Our stories are worthless pearls if there's no tale within.

184
00:24:13,626 --> 00:24:18,626
好き好きのような毎日を 当たり前に手をさしのべて少し知っている
Naturally reaching out hands to days like "I love you," knowing a little.

185
00:24:19,126 --> 00:24:24,626
心温かであることは 笑うほど寂しいことはないでしょう
Being warm-hearted—surely nothing is as lonely as making you smile.

186
00:24:24,926 --> 00:24:29,626
落ち込む夜で最低最悪で 気まぐれなように
On a depressed night, at your worst and most fickle,

187
00:24:30,126 --> 00:24:38,126
どの人生も歩くはないだろう 強がることを知れど 今までの足跡 生まれたことは消えやしない
No life is impossible to walk; knowing how to act tough, the footsteps remain.

188
00:24:38,626 --> 00:24:45,126
軽い冗談で傷がついてしまう 柔らかないたままでいい そのままでいい
A light joke leaves a scar, remaining soft and just as you are.

189
00:24:46,126 --> 00:24:52,626
じっと日々を見逃さないで きっと大人ぶるらしくするので かかりきりになるんだ
Don't let days slip by fixedly, acting like grown-ups so we get absorbed.

190
00:24:53,126 --> 00:24:59,926
話はまだ僕ら 真珠の欠片だって無価値 そこに物語がなければ
Our stories are worthless pearls without a tale inside...

191
00:25:00,247 --> 00:25:03,047
からくりの中で回る僕らの血だ
Spinning within the clockwork, it's our blood.

192
00:25:03,527 --> 00:25:05,327
間違ってないね
We aren't wrong, right?

193
00:25:05,667 --> 00:25:10,107
劇ばかりじゃここには立っていないってこと
We wouldn't be standing here with just drama.

194
00:25:11,067 --> 00:25:12,827
気晴らしに今ならどこへだって
For a distraction, right now, anywhere—

195
00:25:13,207 --> 00:25:15,127
光のように気がつかない?
Can't you notice it like light?

196
00:25:15,287 --> 00:25:18,207
間違ってる涙なんてない
There's no such thing as "wrong" tears.

197
00:25:18,947 --> 00:25:23,827
じっと意味を見逃さないで きっと大人もそれらしく造るので
Don't let the meaning slip by; adults make it look convincing.

198
00:25:24,067 --> 00:25:26,687
禍々リになるんだ 核心はまだ僕ら
Turning ominous, the core is still us.

199
