からくりの中で回る僕らの血だ
Spinning within the clockwork, it's our blood.

201
00:25:51,827 --> 00:25:55,847
じっと日日を見逃さないで きっと大人もそれらしく造るので
Don't let the days slip by; adults make it look convincing.

202
00:25:56,027 --> 00:25:58,727
禍々リになるんだ 核心はまだ僕ら
Turning ominous, the core is still us.

203
00:25:58,967 --> 00:26:03,767
真珠のかけらだって無価値 そこに物語がなければ
Even pearl fragments are worthless without a story.

204
00:26:04,107 --> 00:26:07,887
からくりの中で回る僕らは
We, spinning within the clockwork...

205
00:26:08,427 --> 00:26:16,847
成り損なってあふれた 走査線のような幸せを求めている
Seeking happiness like scan lines, overflowing from failure.

206
00:26:17,167 --> 00:26:21,607
感情は絵の具 混ざり合うこの街で当たり前に今
In this town where emotions mix like paints, naturally right now

207
00:26:22,487 --> 00:26:27,847
輝いている
they are shining.

208
00:27:07,267 --> 00:27:13,347
ねえ 気づいて 大切な人は誰
Hey, realize it—who is the most precious person?

209
00:27:21,727 --> 00:27:24,547
青い風が吹いた
A blue wind blew,

210
00:27:25,107 --> 00:27:28,047
二つ影が並んだ
two shadows lined up side by side.

211
00:27:28,667 --> 00:27:34,147
不器用なほどに揺ら揺ら揺れてた
Swaying so clumsily.

212
00:27:35,487 --> 00:27:41,607
意識しないことで 自分自身守っては
Protecting yourself by not being conscious of it,

213
00:27:42,047 --> 00:27:47,527
いつの日か光ったサインを眺めて
gazing at the sign that shines someday.

214
00:27:48,207 --> 00:28:00,127
複雑に見せて 単純な恋なのに 答えが書かれたテストはまだ解けないんだ
Though it seems complex yet simple, the test with answers is still unsolved.

215
00:28:01,007 --> 00:28:07,707
草を生やして ごまかしたって 心まではだませない
Even if you brush it off and fake it, you can't deceive your heart.

216
00:28:08,207 --> 00:28:14,527
このままで言い訳ないよね 時は止まってくれないよ
There's no excuse left to stay like this; time won't stop for us.

217
00:28:15,327 --> 00:28:22,707
素直になって 見つめ合えば 今までの曇り空を 青空へ
If we become honest and gaze at each other, the cloudy skies turn blue.

218
00:28:23,427 --> 00:28:29,947
心どこかから結んだ虹が語る 二人を包み込んで 輝くよ
A rainbow woven from somewhere deep in our hearts shines, wrapping around us.

219
00:28:40,307 --> 00:28:46,507
何気ないことがそう 替えがけないものへ
Things that seem trivial turn into something irreplaceable.

220
00:29:00,927 --> 00:29:06,987
流れ行く雲の切れ目を探した
searching for a break in the passing clouds.

221
00:29:07,607 --> 00:29:12,947
友達以上とか 恋人未満だとか
Like "more than friends" or "less than lovers"—

222
00:29:13,347 --> 00:29:20,007
誰かが決めたルールを 飛び越えてみようよ
let's jump over the rules someone else decided!

223
00:29:20,387 --> 00:29:27,167
意識し合って ありのままで 二人がもっと近づけば
If we're conscious of each other and just as we are, getting closer,

224
00:29:27,747 --> 00:29:33,627
隠し続けてた鼓動はこの空に響いてくよ
the heartbeat we kept hidden will echo across this sky.

225
00:29:33,947 --> 00:29:41,367
戸惑いだってい切なさだって その全てがきっと大切なもの
Confusion, pain—all of those are surely precious things.

226
00:29:42,087 --> 00:29:48,027
二人に見えない 形のない思いを
Feelings without shape, invisible to the two of us—

227
00:29:48,507 --> 00:29:55,447
手繰り寄せればきっと 引き合うよ
if we reel them in, surely we'll pull each other close.

228
00:30:06,284 --> 00:30:09,044
当たり前の帰り道
The ordinary way home,

229
00:30:09,304 --> 00:30:12,544
当たり前の連絡も
and the ordinary messages—

230
00:30:13,104 --> 00:30:18,244
突然なくなるかもしれない
might suddenly disappear.

231
00:30:19,104 --> 00:30:25,944
そっと心に手を当てて聞けばいい きっと
Just gently place your hand on your heart and listen, surely...

232
00:30:27,944 --> 00:30:32,604
答えは一つだから
there is only one answer.

233
00:30:36,944 --> 00:30:43,464
ねぇ 気づいて 大切な人は誰
Hey, realize it—who is the precious person?

234
00:30:44,444 --> 00:30:50,964
嘘をついて ごまかしたって心まではだませない
Even if you lie and brush it off, you can't fool your heart.

235
00:30:51,324 --> 00:30:58,044
眩しすぎるその光の中にふたりが見えるよ
In that dazzling light, I can see the two of us.

236
00:31:01,304 --> 00:31:05,984
素直になって見つめ合えば今までの曇り空は青空へ
If we become honest and gaze at each other, the cloudy skies until now turn into a blue sky.

237
00:31:06,524 --> 00:31:12,024
心と心結んだ虹がかかる
A rainbow connects our hearts.

238
00:31:12,304 --> 00:31:17,584
ふたりを包み込んで輝くよ
It wraps around the two of us and shines bright.

239
00:31:55,315 --> 00:32:02,295
はぁい、ということで……前半が終了しましたけど、みんな盛り上がってるー！
Haai, so... the first half has ended, but everyone, are you getting hyped?!

240
00:32:04,265 --> 00:32:10,245
うん、今回のセットリストは前回よりも比較的新しい曲が多いななんて、思った？
Yeah, did you think that this setlist has relatively newer songs compared to last time?

241
00:32:11,065 --> 00:32:21,405
え、ゲストとのお話とか、なんでこの曲を選んだのかな、とかは、え、そんな感じのお話はまた後日ゆっくりお話しできたらいいなと思っております。
Um, as for talks with guests and why I chose this song, um, I hope we can talk about things like that slowly at a later date.

242
00:32:22,185 --> 00:32:30,025
え、この先もみんなが知っているあの曲やこの曲、え、ゲストもたくさんいるので、まだまだ一緒に盛り上がっていこうね！
Um, from here on too, there are songs everyone knows, and since there are lots of guests, let's keep getting hyped together!

243
00:32:30,535 --> 00:32:38,475
あ、#不知火フレア生誕祭2024 でもまだまだ写真や感想どんどんポストしてくれたら嬉しいぞ！
Ah, I'd be happy if you keep posting photos and impressions with #不知火フレア生誕祭2024!

244
00:32:39,055 --> 00:32:43,875
それでは、後半戦に行きましょう！ ぐーぐーぐーぐー！
Now then, let's head into the second half! Gu-gu-gu-gu!

245
00:32:54,988 --> 00:32:59,188
春泥棒 作詞作曲：n-buna
Haru Dorobou / Lyrics & Music: n-buna

246
00:33:07,323 --> 00:33:10,443
高架橋を抜けたら
As I crossed over the bridge,

247
00:33:10,683 --> 00:33:14,583
雲の隙間に青が覗いた
I could see the blue sky peeking through the clouds.

248
00:33:15,043 --> 00:33:17,503
最近どうも暑いから
It's been really hot lately,

249
00:33:18,003 --> 00:33:21,203
ただ風が吹くのを待ってた
so I was just waiting for the wind to blow.

250
00:33:22,443 --> 00:33:24,663
木陰に座る
Sitting in the shade of a tree,

251
00:33:26,043 --> 00:33:28,623
何か頬に付く
something gets stuck to my cheek.

252
00:33:30,343 --> 00:33:34,643
見上げれば頭上に咲いて散る
Looking up, flowers bloom and scatter overhead.

253
00:33:37,523 --> 00:33:40,623
はらり、僕らもう息も忘れて
Falling softly, we've already forgotten to breathe,

254
00:33:40,623 --> 00:33:43,823
瞬きさえ億劫
even blinking is too much trouble.

255
00:33:45,163 --> 00:33:50,043
さあ、今日さえ明日 過去に変わる ただ風を待つ
Now, even today turns into yesterday's past, just waiting for the wind.

256
00:33:52,743 --> 00:33:59,743
だから僕らもう声も忘れて さよならさえ億劫
That's why we've already forgotten our voices, even goodbyes are too much trouble,

257
00:33:59,743 --> 00:34:03,743
ただ花が降るだけ 晴れ、今、春吹雪
petals just fall down under the clear sky—now, a spring blizzard.

258
00:34:24,223 --> 00:34:26,743
次の日も待ち合わせ
Meeting up again the next day,

259
00:34:27,663 --> 00:34:30,603
花見の客も少なくなった
the cherry blossom viewers have also decreased.

260
00:34:31,623 --> 00:34:34,003
春の匂いはもう止む
The scent of spring is already stopping.

261
00:34:35,183 --> 00:34:38,263
今年も夏が来るのか
Will summer come again this year?

262
00:34:39,503 --> 00:34:42,723
高架橋を抜けたら
As I crossed over the bridge,

263
00:34:43,383 --> 00:34:46,663
道の先に君が覗いた
I could see you peeking out at the end of the path.

264
00:34:47,383 --> 00:34:53,143
残りはどれだけかな どれだけ春に会えるだろう
How much time is left, I wonder? How many more springs will I be able to see?

265
00:34:54,583 --> 00:35:00,143
川沿いの丘、木陰に座る
On the hill along the river, sitting beneath the shade of a tree...

266
00:35:02,086 --> 00:35:06,346
また昨日と変わらず今日も咲く
Blooming today, just like yesterday.

267
00:35:08,946 --> 00:35:12,986
花に、僕らもう息も忘れて
Amidst the flowers, we forget to even breathe,

268
00:35:13,146 --> 00:35:16,906
瞬きさえ億劫
finding even blinking too much trouble.

269
00:35:17,586 --> 00:35:21,106
花散らせ今 吹くこの嵐は
Scatter the blossoms now, this storm blowing through

270
00:35:21,266 --> 00:35:24,666
まさに春泥棒
is truly a spring thief.

271
00:35:25,146 --> 00:35:29,106
風に今日ももう時が流れて
Time flows on with the wind today as well,

272
00:35:29,266 --> 00:35:32,146
立つことさえ億劫
making even standing up too much trouble.

273
00:35:32,666 --> 00:35:36,026
花の隙間に空、
The sky peers through the gaps in the flowers,

274
00:35:36,386 --> 00:35:40,306
散れり まだ 春吹雪
still scattering in a spring snowstorm.

275
00:35:56,146 --> 00:35:58,266
今日も会いにいく
I'm going to see you again today.

276
00:36:00,066 --> 00:36:02,346
木陰に座る
Sitting in the shade of the trees,

277
00:36:03,906 --> 00:36:06,146
溜息を吐く
I let out a sigh.

278
00:36:07,506 --> 00:36:10,346
花ももう終わる
The flowers are almost done,

279
00:36:11,186 --> 00:36:13,546
明日も会いにいく
I'll go see them tomorrow too.

280
00:36:15,186 --> 00:36:17,586
春がもう終わる
Spring is almost over,

281
00:36:19,066 --> 00:36:24,186
名残るように時間が散っていく
and time scatters as if reluctant to leave.

282
00:36:27,346 --> 00:36:30,026
愛を歌えば言葉足らず
